### Dynamic Width fix
variable dens_wid_const equal 1.3
variable N_iter equal 1
variable mix_fact equal 0.4
variable type_avoid equal 10 #ensure ions are not included in SPH loops (must match ion type)

fix all_dyn_wid all dynamic_widths ${dens_wid_const} ${N_iter} ${mix_fact} ${sigma_start} ${cutoff} ${type_avoid} ${pair_name}
